# ── Heavy / local-only tooling accidentally dropped into employee_app ──
# The tinker-chat backend (its own deploy + venv/models, multi-GB) and a
# downloaded Google Cloud SDK do NOT belong in the app repo. tinker-chat
# also carries backend/.env with live API keys — never commit it.
employee_app/tinker-chat/
employee_app/google-cloud-sdk/
employee_app/google-cloud-cli-*.tar.gz

# ── Windows build artifacts (CI output / locally-downloaded) ──
# These are produced by the build-windows workflow (zip + Inno installer);
# the .exe / .zip blow past GitHub's 100 MB file limit and must never be
# committed. Keep them local-only.
employee_app/TpSupport-Setup/
employee_app/TpSupport-windows-x64/
employee_app/TpSupport-windows-x64.zip
employee_app/installer-out/

# Stray secrets, just in case any .env lands in the tree
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
